```

`current_voice_id` is `char[40]` (from `voice_change_name[40]` in translate.c). `new_voice_id` comes from `VoiceFromStack`. If `new_voice_id` is longer than 39 chars, this overflows.

In `VoiceFromStack`:
```c
static char voice_name[40];
...
strcpy(voice_name, ssml_stack[0].voice_name);
```

`ssml_stack[0].voice_name` is `char[40]`. `voice_name` is `char[40]`. `strcpy` copies until null. If `ssml_stack[0].voice_name` is not null-terminated within 40 bytes, `strcpy` reads past the end.

